# Question 2 : KONSA CHANNEL IN- SCOPE HAI ?
---------------------------------------------

Expected answer :

"Email + SMS + Push. WhatsApp abhi out-of-scope (future me add ho sakta hai)."

Har channel ke liye independent Kafka topic aur corresponding DLT maintain karunga, kyunki:

1. Independent Scalability: Har channel ka traffic alag ho sakta hai. Jis channel ka traffic zyada hoga, uske liye more partitions create kar sakte hain aur consumers/workers ka count
                            bhi increase kar sakte hain. Isse increased parallelism aur throughput achieve kar sakte hain.

2. Independent Consumer Configuration: Har channel ka provider different hai — SendGrid (email), Twilio (SMS), FCM (Push). Har provider ka response time, rate limit, aur failure pattern alag hai.
                                      Isliye per-channel retry policy (max attempts, backoff multiplier, timeout) independent configure karna zaroori hai.

3. Separation of Concerns: Har channel ka processing logic independent rahega.

4. Independent Failure Handling: Har channel ka separate DLT rahega, jisse har channel ka failure handling independently manage kar sakte hain.








